Dialogue: 0,00:00:00.00,00:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Play your own videos with FrameIsle.\NNo account or included movies.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:05.00,00:00:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Add Local Folder and authorize it\Nusing the system file picker.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:26.22,00:00:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Import a trusted QR configuration to add your NAS.\NThis demo uses a local test account.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:41.61,00:00:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,SMB discovers shared folders automatically.\NChoose a share to browse its videos.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:53.06,00:01:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Open a video to start playback.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:00.01,00:01:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Drag the timeline to find your place.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:07.15,00:01:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Enter full screen, then use the exit button\Nto return to the player.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:19.85,00:01:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Tap the star to save this folder.\NOpen it again from Favorite Folders.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:31.75,00:01:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the video menu and choose Cache Locally.\NKeep the app open until the download finishes.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:43.08,00:01:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Play the completed local copy from Local Cache.
Dialogue: 0,00:01:55.63,00:02:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Delete the cached copy when you no longer need it.\NThe original NAS file is kept.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:07.73,00:02:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the connection as a QR code.\NPasswords are excluded by default.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:18.94,00:02:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Import a QR image and review it before saving.\NEnter the password separately on the other device.
